estaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","review_id":"RMmG9ARsDNZZKptUEBJ6gw","date":"2019-12-07T17:41:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9429402947425842,"text_excerpt":"I had a great experience here. I knew this place was where Mojo's roasted its coffee beans and didn't even realize they had opened a cafe in the front part. The barista told me it's only been open to customers for 4 months now. The barista was incredibly nice and helpful. They recommended the blueberry lemon muffin and we finished it and ended up buying another one. They were nice enough to heat it up when we asked. The tea and coffee was just as good as their other locations. Since this is where they roast the beans you definitely know the beans were fresh. The tea was also brewed to order. I always love places (like Mojo's) where you can order stuff in mugs and glasses to sip from. It a..."},{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","review_id":"CX8rXdMOOPZkwmb3a1_UXw","date":"2019-09-06T23:20:52","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9295642971992493,"text_excerpt":"This spot is perfect if you're looking to break up your routine and still enjoy a cup of mojo's delicious coffee. Although this shop is only open till about 2/3pm during regular hours you'll get the same great taste and customer service. What separates this location from their spot son Freret and Magazine (although both are like five minutes from here) is this is where they roast and bag their coffees. It's an open space so you get to see everything in action. Do not come here expecting food because they are literally doing you a service by grabbing the coffee as fresh as possible. There are baked goods but don't expect their full kitchen menu. If you're super hungry just grab barracuda a..."},{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","review_id":"cBa9ETYet6sCTQCu3FI-mA","date":"2019-09-20T21:54:58","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9248217344284058,"text_excerpt":"Just moved to the area so haven't had a chance to visit this location. Michael couldn't have been nicer. Told me all about the space. This is where they have been roasting the coffee for all locations. Just opened the front as a cafe in July. Decor is upper cute and homey. Lots of room to spread out. You have a great view to all the behind the scenes roasting stuff happening. Take a minute and stop in to say hi. Delightful."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","photo_id":"4_tZHmYH9eawrmysgI85QQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/4_tZHmYH9eawrmysgI85QQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8667256832122803},{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","photo_id":"qH843C4EPJYg4QqIBbNUqA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qH843C4EPJYg4QqIBbNUqA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8625402450561523},{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","photo_id":"4YUdZ_-CKFkqF6v5hTIuXw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4YUdZ_-CKFkqF6v5hTIuXw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8575868606567383},{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","photo_id":"K1SYJyhI7wkhq9Jsq0QueQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/K1SYJyhI7wkhq9Jsq0QueQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8478928208351135},{"business_id":"tz__wL5D6vb6g3f7Xda84w","photo_id":"0anvSRuhbR9S-PLBlJK0aw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/0anvSRuhbR9S-PLBlJK0aw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8117073774337769}]},"notebook_case":null}
